WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:03.734
选择本轮临时记录 / Select this run’s temporary record

2
00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:06.618
打开隐私默认值 / Open privacy defaults

3
00:00:06.618 --> 00:00:09.431
临时更改 Cookie 默认值 / Temporarily change the Cookie default

4
00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:12.782
打开新的 HAR 导出检查继承 / Open a new HAR export and check defaults

5
00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:15.579
选择当前筛选范围 / Select the current filter scope

6
00:00:15.579 --> 00:00:18.364
查看全部记录范围 / Inspect the all-records scope

7
00:00:18.364 --> 00:00:21.177
只覆盖本次 Cookie 遮罩 / Override Cookie masking for this export

8
00:00:21.177 --> 00:00:23.983
取消本次导出 / Cancel this export

9
00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:26.874
确认单次覆盖没有改默认值 / Verify the override did not change defaults

10
00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:29.684
恢复 Cookie 遮罩默认值 / Restore the Cookie masking default

11
00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:32.552
查看实际存储用量 / Inspect actual storage usage

12
00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:35.358
Refresh 只刷新统计 / Refresh updates statistics only

13
00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:38.152
检查 Clear 影响 / Review Clear effects

14
00:00:38.152 --> 00:00:40.955
取消 Clear 不删除记录 / Cancel Clear without deleting records

15
00:00:40.955 --> 00:00:43.823
确认清理本轮记录和正文 / Confirm clearing this run’s records and bodies

16
00:00:43.823 --> 00:00:46.684
Capture 同步变空且仍暂停 / Capture is empty and remains paused

17
00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:49.547
Clear 后显式恢复录制 / Explicitly resume after Clear

18
00:00:49.547 --> 00:00:52.326
Clear 后捕获新请求 / Capture a new request after Clear
